# welcome-fit-loop-1024x640 (h10-fit): the welcome loop running at fit 0.71,
# no reduced motion; one shot at +1800 (x2, k mid-drag), as h10-loop's
# states. The loop's timing is unchanged by the fit.
route welcome
size 1024 640
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 1800
shot welcome-fit-loop-1024x640
